<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>True</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <Title>Division Compute</Title>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <PackageId>NorthRoc.$(AssemblyName)</PackageId>
    <Version>0.4.0</Version>
    <Authors>Rex Woodfield</Authors>
    <Company>NorthRoc Studios</Company>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <Description>DivisionCompute is a source-to-source compiler and runtime that lets you write HLSL compute shaders directly in C#</Description>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/NorthRocStudios/DivisionCompute</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageTags>compiler;hlsl;shader;translate;compute;gpu;cpu;csharp;windows</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Added:
- C# 7 out-argument declarations and discards (Foo(..., out int x), out _)
- Zero-initialized struct construction (new T()) and default / default(T) values
- float.MaxValue / MinValue / Epsilon and int/uint limit constants in shader code
- [loop] hints on emitted loops (keeps fxc compile time and code size down)
- Semantic-model cache for translated helper classes (large shaders translate ~200x faster)
- Disk bytecode cache for compiled shaders (opt out with DIVISION_DISABLE_SHADER_CACHE=1)
- GetData(ctx, Span&lt;T&gt;) readback overloads for every buffer/texture wrapper
- Explicit ShaderFlags overload on CompileHLSL
Fixed:
- Hexadecimal integer literals ending in F (0xFF) were rewritten as 0x.0
- Helper methods called with nested math.* arguments failed overload resolution
- Roslyn compilation missed the framework facade references (System.Runtime)</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 Rex Woodfield and NorthRoc Studios contributors</Copyright>
    <RootNamespace>DivisionEngine</RootNamespace>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis" Version="5.9.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="NorthRoc.DivisionMath" Version="0.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Vortice.D3DCompiler" Version="3.8.3" />
    <PackageReference Include="Vortice.Direct3D11" Version="3.8.3" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
